<% layout('/layouts/base', { title: it.t('privacy.title') }) %>
<article class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
  <h1 class="h1"><%= it.t('privacy.title') %></h1>
  <p class="todo">Draft text to be reviewed by a professional. It describes how the website is designed to work; on its own it does not guarantee GDPR compliance. The French version prevails.</p>
  <h2>Data controller</h2>
  <p>Ti Mango, 12 rue de la Plage, 97180 Sainte-Anne, Guadeloupe — <a href="mailto:<%= it.restaurant.email %>"><%= it.restaurant.email %></a>.</p>
  <h2>Data collected and purpose</h2>
  <p>When you book: name, phone, email, number of guests, date, time and, if you wish, a note. This data is used only to record and manage your booking (confirmation, cancellation, contacting you if something comes up).</p>
  <p>If you mention an allergy in the note, it is used only to prepare your meal. Please share only what is useful.</p>
  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>Steps taken at your request prior to entering into a contract (Article 6(1)(b) GDPR).</p>
  <h2>Recipients</h2>
  <p>The restaurant team and our technical providers (hosting, sending confirmation emails): [names to be completed]. Data is never sold or used for advertising.</p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>[Period to be confirmed — proposed: 12 months after the booking date], then deleted or anonymised.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>The public website sets no analytics or advertising cookies. One strictly necessary cookie is used only in the restaurant's private admin area. Fonts are served by the website itself and the map only loads if you open the OpenStreetMap link.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You may access, correct or erase your data, object to or restrict its processing by writing to <a href="mailto:<%= it.restaurant.email %>"><%= it.restaurant.email %></a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the CNIL, the French data protection authority (cnil.fr).</p>
</article>
